      "message": "Thank you Cole. \n\nI was thinking adding more (like aosp/3367942) and wanted to make this work with new properties without extending ;-)\n\nRegarding `a.testApex` I think the current implementation (adding the prop structure to `apex_test` module only) works nice.\n\nHow about moving away from `reflect`, but keeping the prop structure?\n\n```\nfunc (a *apexBundle) skipValidation(name string) bool {\n\tif !a.testApex {\n\t\treturn false\n\t}\n\tswitch name {\n\tcase \"host_apex_verifier\":\n\t\treturn proptools.BoolDefault(a.testProperties.Skip_validations.Host_apex_verifier, false)\n\tdefault:\n\t\tpanic(\"unknown property: apex.skip_validations.\" + name)\n\t}\n}\n```",
